def quantumProcessingToolboxesFlow_description16 : String := "The end-to-end gate as a repetition code. standards: true compares every quantum standard with every other and writes one pages seed per pair. Without answers: every combination the dashboards lay out and every example of the textbook, as one tools/call request per host (default the tenants' hosts and the operator's), each carrying the hash of the tree's own answer. With answers (each request plus status, ms, text): every combination decoded by majority over the tree and the hosts — agree, corrected (a flipped host, named by the syndrome), erased (a host that did not answer), uncorrectable (no majority) — the physical and logical error rates against the textbook 3-copy code, every error a UUID block for the stream, and the leads. Pure; the client fetches."
