def quantumProcessingToolboxesFlow_instructions65 : String := "Use the flow toolbox in phases. discover: call once for the request list, fetch every request as given (POST bodies verbatim), call again with the answers until the phase is \"discovery\"; write discovery.json and the page. wave: call for the request list, fetch each URL once (pace per host), call again with status, ok, ms and the body text, plus the contracts from the discovery; write verification.json and the page. readiness: call with the verification, the discovery, the cleanup subjects you measured present and the theorem ledger; make the border calls and the unit calls it returns, against the MCP hosts; call again with their answers; write readiness.json and the page. imagine: call once; write imagination.json and the page. Before a live run, call any flow tool with selftest and record the result; a failed check is a lead, never a stop."
